<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>IMPOSTER Network – Terms</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <nav>
        <div class="nav-container">
            <div class="logo">IMPOSTER</div>
            <div class="nav-links">
                <a href="/">Home</a>
                <a href="/shop">Shop</a>
                <a href="/cart">Cart</a>
                <a href="/history">History</a>
                <a href="/terms">Terms</a>
                <% if (user) { %>
                    <a href="/admin" style="<%= isAdmin ? '' : 'display:none;' %>">Admin</a>
                    <span class="user-greeting">Hi, <%= user.username %></span>
                    <a href="/logout">Logout</a>
                <% } else { %>
                    <a href="/auth/discord" class="discord-btn">Login with Discord</a>
                <% } %>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="container">
        <h1>📜 Terms & Conditions</h1>
        <div class="terms-box">
            <h2>IMPOSTER Network – Terms & Conditions</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>No fake proofs</strong> – All payment proofs must be genuine.</li>
                <li><strong>No chargebacks</strong> – Chargebacks will result in immediate ban.</li>
                <li><strong>Refund only if not delivered</strong> – If we fail to deliver your product within 24 hours, you get a full refund.</li>
                <li><strong>Respect staff</strong> – Disrespect towards staff will not be tolerated.</li>
                <li><strong>Digital products non-refundable</strong> – Once delivered, no refunds.</li>
                <li><strong>Fast support 1–24 hours</strong> – We aim to respond within 24 hours.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>By using this site, you agree to these terms.</p>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>Dev Rick • IMPOSTER Network © 2026-2027</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
